    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How many deaths can you remember?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to...</strong> is a <strong>loop-based text adventure</strong> where death is not the end, but a path to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i>Flanel</i>, a young noble who has lost his memory and is caught in a cycle of death and rebirth. Explore a crumbling kingdom, interact with a wide range of characters, and face turn-based combat scenarios that change with each loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> <br>\u2013 Deep narrative with branching choices that affect future loops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/112ecf914b9fe78239b760f0e4d2fb8e.poster.avif?t=1752461773\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/112ecf914b9fe78239b760f0e4d2fb8e.webm?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/112ecf914b9fe78239b760f0e4d2fb8e.mp4?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Turn-based combat with attribute-based skills and status effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/2481e2875937ccb40ebbeb4e55602865.poster.avif?t=1752461773\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/2481e2875937ccb40ebbeb4e55602865.webm?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/2481e2875937ccb40ebbeb4e55602865.mp4?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Collectible journals and secrets scattered throughout the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Story-driven gameplay with multiple endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Hand-crafted text events, lore-rich locations, and original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery. Rewrite fate. Return, again and again...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How many deaths can you remember?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to...</strong> is a <strong>loop-based text adventure</strong> where death is not the end, but a path to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i>Flanel</i>, a young noble who has lost his memory and is caught in a cycle of death and rebirth. Explore a crumbling kingdom, interact with a wide range of characters, and face turn-based combat scenarios that change with each loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> <br>\u2013 Deep narrative with branching choices that affect future loops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/112ecf914b9fe78239b760f0e4d2fb8e.poster.avif?t=1752461773\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/112ecf914b9fe78239b760f0e4d2fb8e.webm?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/112ecf914b9fe78239b760f0e4d2fb8e.mp4?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Turn-based combat with attribute-based skills and status effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/2481e2875937ccb40ebbeb4e55602865.poster.avif?t=1752461773\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/2481e2875937ccb40ebbeb4e55602865.webm?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758800/extras/2481e2875937ccb40ebbeb4e55602865.mp4?t=1752461773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Collectible journals and secrets scattered throughout the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Story-driven gameplay with multiple endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Hand-crafted text events, lore-rich locations, and original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery. Rewrite fate. Return, again and again...</p>",
